---
title: 梯度稀释涂板菌落计数（CFU）
scheduled_date: ""
stage: planned
tags:
  - 微生物
  - CFU
---

> **实验目标**：通过 10 倍系列稀释与琼脂涂板，在 **30–300 CFU** 有效计数区间内计算原液活菌浓度（CFU/mL）。

## 实验分组与平皿排布

```asterlab
kind: group_table
id: gt-cfu
schema: 1
title: 菌落计数样本与稀释组
rows:
  - id: g-stock
    name: 原液样本组（10^-4 ~ 10^-5）
    role: treatment
    condition: S. aureus 对数期菌悬液
    independent_n: 3
  - id: g-neg
    name: 无菌稀释液阴性对照
    role: control
    condition: 无菌 PBS 空涂板
    independent_n: 2
```

```asterlab
kind: plate
id: dish-cfu
schema: 1
title: 90 mm 涂布平皿排布
format: 24
topology: dish
rows: 2
columns: 4
groups:
  g-neg: [A1, A2]
  g-stock: [B1, B2, B3, B4]
roles:
  A1: blank
  A2: blank
  B1: sample
  B2: sample
  B3: sample
  B4: sample
samples:
  A1: DIL-BLANK-1
  A2: DIL-BLANK-2
  B1: CFU-10e-4-1
  B2: CFU-10e-4-2
  B3: CFU-10e-5-1
  B4: CFU-10e-5-2
```

#@ 1. 10 倍梯度系列稀释（10⁻¹ ~ 10⁻⁶）

从约 10⁸ CFU/mL 菌悬液原液进行 10 倍连续稀释 6 级，每管终体积 1 mL。

- [ ] 6 支无菌离心管预先各分装 **900 uL 无菌 PBS**
- [ ] 从上级管移取 **100 uL** 菌液加入下一管并涡旋混匀 10 s
- [ ] **每转移一级更换新无菌吸头**，防止交叉带菌导致高倍稀释虚高

```asterlab
kind: calculator
id: blk-cfu-serial
schema: 1
title: 10 倍系列稀释梯度计算（10^-1 ~ 10^-6）
mode: serial_dilution
dilution_factor: 10
steps_count: 6
stock: {value: 100000000, unit: CFU/mL}
volume_per_unit: {value: 1, unit: mL}
```

#@ 2. 平皿涂布与 37 °C 恒温培养 {#t0}

- [ ] 选取 10⁻⁴、10⁻⁵ 稀释液及阴性对照 PBS，各吸取 **0.1 mL** 滴加至琼脂平板中央并均匀涂布
- [ ] 静置晾干至表面无游离液膜后，37 °C 倒置培养 24 h

```asterlab
kind: param_table
id: blk-cfu-params
schema: 1
title: 涂布与培养条件
rows:
  - key: plated_ml
    label: 单皿涂布体积
    value: 0.1
    unit: mL
  - key: temp
    label: 培养温度
    value: 37
    unit: Cel
```

```asterlab
kind: timer
id: blk-cfu-timer
schema: 1
title: 37 °C 菌落形成倒置培养
mode: countdown
status: idle
duration: {value: 24, unit: h}
```

#@ 3. 30–300 有效区间判定与 CFU/mL 换算

- [ ] 确认阴性对照平板无可见菌落（0 CFU）
- [ ] 仅选用菌落数在 **30–300 CFU** 有效区间的稀释梯度进行换算；若全部超出则按 TNTC / TFTC 备注并重测

```asterlab
kind: data_table
id: blk-cfu-table
schema: 1
title: 平皿菌落计数与原液浓度计算表
schema_id: cfu_plate_count
endpoint: viable_count
columns:
  - key: well
    label: 平皿/样本
    value_kind: text
  - key: colonies
    label: 菌落数
    value_kind: number
    unit: CFU
    min: 30
    max: 300
  - key: dilution
    label: 稀释系数
    value_kind: number
    unit: "1"
  - key: plated_ml
    label: 涂布体积
    value_kind: number
    unit: mL
  - key: cfu_ml
    label: 原液活菌浓度
    value_kind: formula
    formula: "colonies / (dilution * plated_ml)"
    unit: CFU/mL
rows:
  - well: B1 (10^-4-1)
    dilution: 0.0001
    plated_ml: 0.1
  - well: B2 (10^-4-2)
    dilution: 0.0001
    plated_ml: 0.1
  - well: B3 (10^-5-1)
    dilution: 0.00001
    plated_ml: 0.1
  - well: B4 (10^-5-2)
    dilution: 0.00001
    plated_ml: 0.1
```
